HOW THE WORK WAS MADE

The site was designed by Karolina Kita and built with the help of Claude Code, an AI
coding assistant from Anthropic. Under Anthropic's terms, the rights in the assistant's
output belong to its user, and they are part of the Work covered by this notice.

